      "widgets_values": [
        "One continuous unedited cinematic shot of the same woman in a dark green coat carrying the small tan leather shoulder bag on the wet sidewalk beside the red brick wall. Start with the same side-on medium wide framing, the woman still walking steadily from left to right, with natural arm swing and uninterrupted footsteps. After the opening second, she naturally slows to a stop. She lifts the tan bag in front of her waist, opens its flap with both hands, looks down and retrieves a small brass key with her right hand. She holds the key visibly between her fingers and looks up with a slight relieved smile. Throughout this action the camera smoothly arcs about thirty degrees around toward her front and gently pushes in from the medium wide side view to a medium three-quarter view. The wall and wet pavement keep their real geometry and the same overcast soft daylight. Realistic fabric, skin and coherent hand movements. The camera move is physical and continuous, no cuts, no dissolves, no time jumps. Audio: the footsteps slow and stop naturally, soft leather bag rustling, a delicate key jingle, continuous low outdoor city ambience. No music, no dialogue.",
        736,
        416,
        175
